### Wanderly API walkthrough (VS Code REST Client / IntelliJ HTTP client)
@base = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Register: no token yet; a 6-digit code is emailed (open Mailpit at http://localhost:8025)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "demo@example.com", "password": "correct-horse-battery", "name": "Demo" }

### 2. Verify: paste the code from the email. Returns accessToken (for API clients; browsers get an httpOnly
### session cookie from the same response). Codes are single use and expire in 10 min.
### Auth endpoints are rate limited per IP: too many attempts return 429 with Retry-After.
# @name verify
POST {{base}}/api/auth/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "demo@example.com", "code": "123456" }

###
@token = {{verify.response.body.accessToken}}

### Resend a code (always 202, max one new code per minute)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/resend-code
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "demo@example.com" }

### Login
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "demo@example.com", "password": "correct-horse-battery" }

### Log out (browser session): deletes the httpOnly session cookie
POST {{base}}/api/auth/logout

### Forgot password: always 202; verified accounts get a 6-digit reset code by email
POST {{base}}/api/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "demo@example.com" }

### Reset password: code + new password. Returns a new token; tokens issued before this stop working.
POST {{base}}/api/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "demo@example.com", "code": "123456", "password": "a-brand-new-password" }

### Set preferences (drives ranking, itinerary pace and interests)
PUT {{base}}/api/users/me/preferences
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "interests": ["history", "museum", "food"], "budgetLevel": "mid", "travelPace": "balanced" }

### F2 Search events (public)
# @name events
GET {{base}}/api/events?city=Bengaluru

### Trip ideas (public): where and how long; the web app opens the planner with them
GET {{base}}/api/trips

### F3 Save an event to your plans -> publishes event.saved to Kafka (idempotent: saving twice is a no-op)
PUT {{base}}/api/saved-events/{{events.response.body.items[0].id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### My saved events
GET {{base}}/api/saved-events
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### F7 Food + attractions near an event's venue (public; personalised with a token)
GET {{base}}/api/events/{{events.response.body.items[0].id}}/nearby
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### F11 Inbox (written asynchronously by the Kafka notification consumer)
GET {{base}}/api/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Remove it from your plans -> publishes event.unsaved
DELETE {{base}}/api/saved-events/{{events.response.body.items[0].id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List an event in a city with no events yet (venue is geocoded near the city; else the city centre)
# @name listed
POST {{base}}/api/events
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Sunset folk music", "category": "music", "venue": "Ambrai Ghat", "city": "Udaipur",
  "lat": 24.5854, "lng": 73.7125, "startTime": "2026-10-20T12:30:00Z", "price": 0,
  "description": "Folk music by the lake." }

### Events I listed
GET {{base}}/api/events/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Remove my listing (only whoever listed it, or an admin)
DELETE {{base}}/api/events/{{listed.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### F5 Nearby tourist spots (public; personalised when a token is sent)
GET {{base}}/api/places/nearby?lat=12.9716&lng=77.5946&radiusKm=5&category=museum,history
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### F6 Preview an itinerary without logging in (nothing saved)
POST {{base}}/api/itineraries/preview
Content-Type: application/json

{ "destination": "Jaipur", "lat": 26.9124, "lng": 75.7873, "startDate": "2026-10-17", "endDate": "2026-10-18" }

### F6 Generate and save a 3-day itinerary
POST {{base}}/api/itineraries
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "destination": "Bengaluru",
  "lat": 12.9716, "lng": 77.5946,
  "startDate": "2026-10-10", "endDate": "2026-10-12",
  "travelPace": "balanced"
}

### Saved itineraries
GET {{base}}/api/itineraries
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### F10 Personalised feed
GET {{base}}/api/recommendations/feed?city=Bengaluru
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
